>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Notification 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/07/2026</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>21&nbsp; Years</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Years&nbsp;</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per Uttar Pradesh UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Rules Advt No 14/2026.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Recruitment 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Vacancy Details Total : 1829 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 29.103%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"3\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.6689%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.3311%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"5\"><strong>UPSSSC Assistant Accountant &amp; Auditor Exam Eligibility</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 161px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 29.103%; text-align: center; height: 161px;\" colspan=\"3\">Auditor and Assistant Accountant</td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6689%; text-align: center; height: 161px;\" colspan=\"2\">1829</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%; text-align: center; height: 161px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">UPSSSC PET 2025 PET Score Card</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Bachelor Degree from Any Recognized University.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">NIELIT ‘O’ Level Certificate</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">For Post &amp; Department Wise Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>For UPSSSC Advt No 14-Exam/2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Category Wise Vacancy Details Read the Notification</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 401px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%; height: 401px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Recruitment for Various Post Candidate Can Apply Between <b>14/07/2026 to 03/08/2026</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Advt No 14-Exam/2026 Recruitment 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%; height: 146px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 52.7719%; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.3311%; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.103%; text-align: center; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #