lspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"UPSSSC Official Website\" href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UPSSSC Official Website</a></b><b>&nbsp;</b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">1. When did the UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant&nbsp; Online Form 2026 start?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process for UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Recruitment 2026 started on <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"455\">14 July&nbsp; 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>2. What is the last date to apply online for UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Recruitment 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to submit the online application form is <strong data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"634\">03 August 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>3. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">03 August 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>4. When will the UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Examination be conducted?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The examination will be conducted <strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"941\">As per Schedule by the UPSSSC</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>5. Where can I find the syllabus for the Auditor and Assistant Accountant Mains Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme for the Auditor and Assistant Accountant Mains Examination are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>6. How can I apply for UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Advt No 14Exam/2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_22367\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-22367\" style=\"width: 1462px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22367\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201472%20963'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Recruitment 2026\" width=\"1472\" height=\"963\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026.png 1472w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026-300x196.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026-1024x670.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026-768x502.png 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1472px) 100vw, 1472px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026.png\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22367\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026.png\" alt=\"UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Recruitment 2026\" width=\"1472\" height=\"963\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026.png 1472w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026-300x196.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026-1024x670.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/upsssc14exam2026-768x502.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1472px) 100vw, 1472px\" /></noscript><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-22367\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">UPSSSC Auditor and Assistant Accountant Recruitment 2026</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Main Pajes 2 -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
